WEBVTT

00:04:29.637 --> 00:04:32.185
According to the Human Rights Campaign,

00:04:32.209 --> 00:04:37.819
there have been 128 killings
of trans people

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:41.389
in 87 cities across 32 states

00:04:41.413 --> 00:04:43.029
since 2013.

00:04:43.053 --> 00:04:46.456
And those are the only the reported cases.

00:04:47.613 --> 00:04:52.453
And 80 percent of those killings
were of trans women of color.

00:04:54.082 --> 00:04:58.179
The queer situation is bleak,

00:04:58.203 --> 00:04:59.409
to say the least.